Prerequisites

Ensure you have python 3.9, or 3.10
Please go to our private cloud or a terminal of Ubuntu 22.04 

Create a python virtual environment:
$ python -m venv .venv

Activate the python virtual environment:
$ source .venv/bin/activate

Ensure you have pandas and pydantic installed:
$ pip install pandas pydantic requests


Batch Processing Pipeline Script (onet_etl_pipeline.py)
This script processes raw tabular data dumps from O*NET, cleans null values, enforces data types, and exports clean JSONL and CSV deliverables.
$ python onet_etl_pipeline.py


